# Metrics are records written by the tooling, not source. Prettier collapses the short arrays that
# JSON.stringify(x, null, 2) always expands, so every run would fail format:check — and reformatting
# them rewrites evidence that is supposed to stay byte-stable.
specs/*/metrics/

# Same reasoning for the spec itself: its generated half is written by `pnpm enrich` and the table
# padding it emits varies per run, so format:check would go red on a file nobody is allowed to edit.
specs/*/spec.md

node_modules
dist
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Hand-written prompts, distributed verbatim. Reformatting would alter text no AI may edit.
CONCEPT.md
.ai/
